WEBVTT

00:00:07.650 --> 00:00:12.650
Episode 4
Most Special Person

00:00:20.050 --> 00:00:21.540
<i>Nothing is happening.</i>

00:00:22.170 --> 00:00:25.410
<i>The important parts are disappearing.</i>

00:00:28.590 --> 00:00:30.790
<i>Just what am I missing?</i>

00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:46.690
<i>This is bad. I've lost too much blood.</i>

00:00:47.550 --> 00:00:49.940
I-I'll protect you.

00:00:50.810 --> 00:00:55.320
I will protect you... Without fail, I will.

00:00:58.530 --> 00:01:01.660
Next time, I will be the one to protect you!

00:01:10.960 --> 00:01:15.340
<i>He wished to protect me from 
the depths of his soul.</i>

00:01:17.300 --> 00:01:19.310
<i>I am the Youmeishi.</i>

00:01:19.310 --> 00:01:22.620
<i>I reign at the pinnacle 
of all spiritual ability.</i>

00:01:23.060 --> 00:01:26.100
<i>Calm down, Tanmoku Ki.</i>

00:01:26.970 --> 00:01:29.020
<i>What can you do?</i>

00:01:36.490 --> 00:01:42.500
<i>~Bond of the Underworld~</i>

00:03:10.850 --> 00:03:13.790
Huh? Wh-Where am I?

00:03:15.660 --> 00:03:17.130
<i>What happened to me?</i>

00:03:20.100 --> 00:03:21.130
Tanmoku Ki!

00:03:27.020 --> 00:03:28.350
You're awake.

00:03:28.850 --> 00:03:32.350
Shin Shiyou, where are we? 
Where's Tanmoku Ki?

00:03:33.070 --> 00:03:35.360
This is a hotel room.

00:03:36.370 --> 00:03:39.790
I just arrived here this 
morning with Jimei-san.

00:03:39.790 --> 00:03:42.810
We came to bring you and Tanmoku-san back.

00:03:48.190 --> 00:03:51.750
Tanmoku-san is all right. 
He's in the next room.

00:03:52.030 --> 00:03:54.500
What about the guys who attacked us?

00:03:54.940 --> 00:03:58.250
We only found the two of you and Ouyou there.

00:03:59.290 --> 00:04:02.680
I couldn't get a hold of 
Tanmoku-san last night,

00:04:02.680 --> 00:04:05.590
and I thought it was strange, so we came 
straight away to look for him.

00:04:05.590 --> 00:04:08.010
But we were a bit too late.

00:04:08.010 --> 00:04:09.740
Why did you get—

00:04:10.310 --> 00:04:11.810
That's when I...

00:04:14.100 --> 00:04:16.110
...was summoned.

00:04:17.270 --> 00:04:21.070
He gave you his spiritual power.

00:04:22.530 --> 00:04:27.870
It's unheard of for a Youmeishi to 
go that far for their spirit shadow.

00:04:28.970 --> 00:04:36.130
Come, Shiyou. I can't quit halfway.

00:04:36.630 --> 00:04:39.900
Help me, please.

00:04:41.770 --> 00:04:47.270
That was the first time he said my name 
and the first time I touched his hand.

00:04:49.560 --> 00:04:52.100
Gosh, I'm so embarrassed!

00:04:52.100 --> 00:04:54.250
If  just touching his hand
 excites you this much,

00:04:54.250 --> 00:04:56.350
kissing him would probably
 make your soul fly out.

00:04:56.760 --> 00:04:58.860
Anyway, who's looking after him?

00:04:59.730 --> 00:05:02.290
Jimei-san wouldn't let me!

00:05:02.290 --> 00:05:03.480
Why not?

00:05:03.480 --> 00:05:07.200
He wouldn't tell me, and I was 
kicked out without discussion.

00:05:20.310 --> 00:05:22.430
He's apparently all right. Don't worry.

00:05:22.430 --> 00:05:24.300
Is that so? I'm glad.

00:05:24.770 --> 00:05:28.430
What scoundrel would dare raise a hand 
against the Youmeishi?

00:05:28.430 --> 00:05:32.680
We are currently looking into that.
 Please try to get some rest.

00:05:44.030 --> 00:05:45.190
Tanmoku Ki!

00:05:46.140 --> 00:05:49.430
Are you all right? Are you in any pain?

00:05:50.620 --> 00:05:54.750
You haven't lost your memory? 
What about your spiritual powers?

00:05:56.010 --> 00:06:02.880
Tanmoku Ki, I'm all right. 
I'm sorry for sulking.

00:06:03.220 --> 00:06:04.880
I'm the one who is at fault.

00:06:04.880 --> 00:06:10.140
I summoned you without thinking 
of your feelings. Were you angry?

00:06:10.710 --> 00:06:12.440
It was a bit of a shock.

00:06:12.440 --> 00:06:16.520
<i>But it was nothing compared to
 what you were going through.</i>

00:06:16.520 --> 00:06:20.520
Keika! You just communicated with 
me using spiritual telepathy!

00:06:21.580 --> 00:06:23.220
Wh-What?!

00:06:23.220 --> 00:06:25.980
<i>Did I inadvertently send out my thoughts?</i>

00:06:27.580 --> 00:06:30.010
<i>That's way too embarrassing.</i>

00:06:30.010 --> 00:06:34.940
I didn't think you'd ever forgive me 
for cutting the stone boy's main form.

00:06:36.390 --> 00:06:37.500
Huh?

00:06:39.170 --> 00:06:41.680
Tanmoku Ki! Are you all right?

00:06:41.680 --> 00:06:43.910
Get over here, Ouyou.

00:06:43.910 --> 00:06:47.130
My Tanmoku-san is resting!

00:06:47.820 --> 00:06:49.360
You're not getting paid this time!

00:06:49.360 --> 00:06:53.250
You should've brought more people 
to look after Tanmoku-san!

00:06:53.250 --> 00:06:57.120
Got it. I will do as the goddess commands.

00:06:55.530 --> 00:06:57.120
That's Ouyou?

00:06:57.120 --> 00:07:00.240
Yeah, he's a childhood friend of Shin Shiyou.

00:07:00.240 --> 00:07:05.900
Oh, I get it. Though I don't think that's 
the only reason they get along so well.

00:07:06.450 --> 00:07:09.530
He got closer to me because 
he wanted to win her over.

00:07:09.930 --> 00:07:11.740
So he's your rival in love?

00:07:12.290 --> 00:07:13.690
No, not quite.

00:07:13.690 --> 00:07:18.570
We're not really compatible, and whenever 
we're together, things always go wrong.

00:07:16.670 --> 00:07:20.460
It was only five minutes. 
Can't you just let it go this once?

00:07:18.570 --> 00:07:23.180
Like getting fined for a parking violation 
or getting lost in the wilderness.

00:07:23.180 --> 00:07:25.380
Nooooo!

00:07:26.610 --> 00:07:29.380
Then don't bother with him.
You have me, right?

00:07:31.010 --> 00:07:32.140
I'm going to rest a bit.

00:07:33.700 --> 00:07:37.510
Master, the preparations are complete.
Shall we return home tonight?

00:07:37.510 --> 00:07:38.610
Yes.

00:07:41.630 --> 00:07:44.100
Are you okay to make the trip back?

00:07:44.100 --> 00:07:45.970
I'll be fine, as long as I get some rest.

00:07:45.970 --> 00:07:48.620
You Keika! You get out here, too!

00:07:48.620 --> 00:07:50.130
Okay already!

00:07:53.030 --> 00:07:57.240
<i>He always listens to music when he sleeps, 
but why does he like it so much?</i>

00:07:57.820 --> 00:07:59.380
Hey, Tanmoku Ki.

00:08:00.490 --> 00:08:01.870
<i>He's already asleep?</i>

00:08:16.500 --> 00:08:18.100
Shouken...

00:08:18.100 --> 00:08:21.250
<i>Who is Shouken?</i>

00:08:25.100 --> 00:08:29.730
I will go see the Youmeishi next.

00:08:30.150 --> 00:08:32.240
But then they'll figure out who you are.

00:08:32.550 --> 00:08:34.570
That was revealed long ago.

00:08:34.570 --> 00:08:36.950
The members of the Tanmoku family are shrewd.

00:08:37.320 --> 00:08:39.690
I expect they've already investigated.

00:08:40.390 --> 00:08:44.620
But it matters not. 
The preparations are already complete.

00:08:45.350 --> 00:08:47.900
All that's left is to give a little push.

00:08:54.380 --> 00:08:57.780
Shouken, tomorrow is the 
anniversary of your death.

00:08:58.740 --> 00:09:01.190
I will definitely bring you 
back with my own hands.

00:09:06.770 --> 00:09:08.160
Ki-sama has returned!

00:09:08.160 --> 00:09:09.190
Ki-sama!

00:09:11.110 --> 00:09:12.150
Welcome home.

00:09:13.010 --> 00:09:16.950
He's totally changed. The moment he 
gets home, he's back to his proper self.

00:09:17.390 --> 00:09:21.100
Of course he is. He's the 
head of the household.

00:09:21.100 --> 00:09:23.080
He has to maintain his dignity.

00:09:23.080 --> 00:09:26.060
Besides, he's always being targeted,

00:09:26.060 --> 00:09:29.950
so if he shows even the slightest weakness,
 it'll be taken advantage of.

00:09:31.020 --> 00:09:33.840
That's why I want you to promise me that,

00:09:33.840 --> 00:09:37.340
no matter what happens, 
you won't leave his side.

00:09:37.340 --> 00:09:39.660
<i>Sh-Shin Shiyou...</i>

00:09:43.490 --> 00:09:46.350
I'm going out. You stay here.

00:09:46.350 --> 00:09:47.440
No way!

00:09:47.960 --> 00:09:50.500
Bad things happen to you way too easily.

00:09:50.500 --> 00:09:52.820
Do you really think I'll let you go alone?

00:09:52.820 --> 00:09:54.380
Do what you will.

00:09:59.510 --> 00:10:01.700
You're visiting a grave?

00:10:01.700 --> 00:10:04.690
While we're here, why don't 
we go visit your own grave?

00:10:04.690 --> 00:10:06.080
But why?!

00:10:06.080 --> 00:10:09.830
Grave of You Keika

00:10:08.270 --> 00:10:12.050
Ugh, visiting my own grave is so weird.

00:10:12.050 --> 00:10:13.960
What? Are you displeased with this grave?

00:10:14.860 --> 00:10:17.860
Honestly, I still don't feel like I'm dead.

00:10:18.770 --> 00:10:21.720
You're rich, so make my grave extravagant.

00:10:21.720 --> 00:10:25.510
You don't have any relatives, so 
the government office buried you.

00:10:25.510 --> 00:10:30.350
I can't really say anything. Besides, 
you're living in a mansion now, right?

00:10:30.350 --> 00:10:33.660
I guess that's true, but I don't really get it...

00:10:33.660 --> 00:10:36.230
The remains that are in this grave and 
the me that's here right now...

00:10:37.270 --> 00:10:39.650
Which one is the real You Keika?

00:10:39.650 --> 00:10:40.990
Both are.

00:10:40.990 --> 00:10:44.180
The body is just a vessel 
to carry the heart and soul.

00:10:44.180 --> 00:10:47.620
The soul transcends the body 
and time without extinguishing.

00:10:48.150 --> 00:10:52.230
Those who persist with nowhere to go 
will become evil spirits,

00:10:53.230 --> 00:10:55.090
but I won't let that happen to you.

00:10:55.630 --> 00:10:59.700
<i>So the reason I'm here now is 
because I have somewhere to go?</i>

00:11:00.630 --> 00:11:04.060
Does that mean I have a place to go back to?

00:11:04.060 --> 00:11:07.500
From now on, I will be your family.

00:11:08.530 --> 00:11:11.600
<i>Is that what he meant?</i>

00:11:11.600 --> 00:11:13.360
Will you offer alcohol to your grave?

00:11:13.360 --> 00:11:18.490
I-I'd rather not. Offering alcohol 
to myself seems like bad luck.

00:11:19.380 --> 00:11:21.950
Whose grave did you come here to visit?

00:11:22.490 --> 00:11:24.190
A friend's.

00:11:22.490 --> 00:11:24.740
Grave of Shinryuu Shouken

00:11:25.410 --> 00:11:26.280
This person?

00:11:35.510 --> 00:11:37.370
He gave this to me.

00:11:38.590 --> 00:11:41.490
I want to make his wish come true.

00:11:41.490 --> 00:11:45.460
If I can do that, then I can go 
see him without reservations.

00:11:45.460 --> 00:11:47.450
Do you really think you can see him?

00:11:52.230 --> 00:11:54.890
You are not worthy to see him.

00:11:54.890 --> 00:11:55.810
Who are you?

00:11:58.510 --> 00:12:02.020
Don't be so on edge.
I came to visit Shouken's grave, too.

00:12:02.900 --> 00:12:04.660
You know Shouken?

00:12:05.140 --> 00:12:06.670
Of course I do.

00:12:06.670 --> 00:12:08.160
Much better than you.

00:12:08.850 --> 00:12:11.290
I lived with him far 
longer than you ever did.

00:12:12.510 --> 00:12:13.540
Who are you?

00:12:14.450 --> 00:12:16.380
That doesn't matter.

00:12:16.380 --> 00:12:18.250
What's important is...

00:12:19.620 --> 00:12:23.130
where is Shouken now?

00:12:23.130 --> 00:12:26.140
Shouken is dead and buried here.

00:12:26.950 --> 00:12:30.720
Are you sure? Did you see his soul?

00:12:33.100 --> 00:12:35.060
<i>What the heck is he talking about?</i>

00:12:38.030 --> 00:12:41.730
What if he disappeared because
 he didn't want to see you again?

00:12:41.730 --> 00:12:45.070
Did you ever think he might 
not actually be dead?

00:12:46.220 --> 00:12:50.650
That's not possible!
 I saw him die with my own eyes!

00:12:58.850 --> 00:13:00.590
I attended his funeral!

00:13:00.960 --> 00:13:02.700
Oh, really?

00:13:11.300 --> 00:13:12.950
I-It's empty!

00:13:16.690 --> 00:13:19.110
Th-That can't be...

00:13:19.110 --> 00:13:23.530
That spirit shadow stabbed you while
 you were driving and you almost died.

00:13:24.660 --> 00:13:27.720
Do you really think you could 
recover from such a perilous state

00:13:28.150 --> 00:13:32.060
with that girl's Nenyou ceremony?

00:13:34.110 --> 00:13:37.460
Use your head and think about it.

00:13:50.010 --> 00:13:51.690
You're clever, aren't you?

00:13:51.690 --> 00:13:54.220
You should be able to 
see through such tricks.

00:13:54.220 --> 00:13:57.480
Say anything more and I will kill you!

00:13:59.140 --> 00:14:00.860
So terrifying.

00:14:03.470 --> 00:14:05.610
Hey, Tanmoku Ki, where are you going?

00:14:07.500 --> 00:14:10.700
I won't hold back if you 
show yourself to us again!

00:14:19.130 --> 00:14:21.120
Ki-sama, you mustn't do this.

00:14:21.120 --> 00:14:24.600
Jiun-sama is currently in a meeting.
Please wait until it is finished.

00:14:24.600 --> 00:14:27.340
Please, those are our orders from Jiun-sama.

00:14:27.340 --> 00:14:28.490
Out of my way!

00:14:27.340 --> 00:14:28.490
Please wait!

00:14:28.470 --> 00:14:30.300
You mustn't, Ki-sama!

00:14:38.650 --> 00:14:40.750
Master, we are in a meeting.

00:14:40.750 --> 00:14:42.230
Where's Shouken?

00:14:43.430 --> 00:14:44.260
Master—

00:14:44.260 --> 00:14:46.440
Where are you hiding Shouken?!

00:14:47.410 --> 00:14:49.450
This meeting is adjourned.

00:14:50.980 --> 00:14:52.700
What is the meaning of this, Ki-niisan?

00:14:53.910 --> 00:14:56.190
That was an important meeting.

00:14:58.050 --> 00:15:01.250
Tell me where Shouken is.

00:15:01.690 --> 00:15:03.960
You're causing all this 
fuss over a dead person?

00:15:04.300 --> 00:15:05.710
Where is Shouken?!

00:15:06.080 --> 00:15:08.470
Shinryuu Shouken is dead.

00:15:08.470 --> 00:15:13.260
His grave was empty!
Where did you hide him?!

00:15:13.260 --> 00:15:14.470
What are you saying?

00:15:15.310 --> 00:15:17.420
Jiun, have you forgotten?

00:15:18.720 --> 00:15:20.570
I am short-tempered.

00:15:21.970 --> 00:15:24.770
I haven't seen this Tanmoku Ki in a while.

00:15:28.620 --> 00:15:30.550
Fine, come with me.

00:15:42.070 --> 00:15:46.070
Promise that no matter what 
you see, you won't get upset.

00:15:47.300 --> 00:15:49.920
Otherwise, I can't open the door.

00:16:18.820 --> 00:16:20.750
He was shot in the head.

00:16:21.140 --> 00:16:24.860
We tried our best, but this was 
all we could do to save him.

00:16:25.690 --> 00:16:29.250
Why? Why is he like this?

00:16:30.650 --> 00:16:33.510
His blood is the only one that 
is compatible with yours!

00:16:33.510 --> 00:16:37.030
If we hadn't done this, 
you would have died long ago.

00:16:37.030 --> 00:16:41.350
Is keeping me alive really 
that important to you?

00:16:48.700 --> 00:16:49.830
That's right.

00:16:50.670 --> 00:16:55.740
I'm alive because I'm important 
to the Tanmoku family.

00:17:03.230 --> 00:17:04.410
Tanmoku Ki!

00:17:15.060 --> 00:17:17.340
I even participated in his funeral.

00:17:34.110 --> 00:17:35.370
Tanmoku Ki!

00:17:36.610 --> 00:17:39.390
This isn't good for your health.
 Let's go back inside.

00:17:46.500 --> 00:17:47.570
Tanmoku...

00:17:48.120 --> 00:17:50.590
<i>I've never seen Tanmoku Ki like this.</i>

00:17:50.590 --> 00:17:54.670
<i>Who exactly is Shinryuu Shouken?</i>

00:17:55.970 --> 00:18:02.260
He was the most faithful friend 
and the most heartless traitor.

00:18:11.750 --> 00:18:12.570
Tanmoku Ki!

00:18:16.150 --> 00:18:17.070
Tanmoku Ki!

00:18:17.440 --> 00:18:19.570
What? He's in a coma?

00:18:19.570 --> 00:18:24.320
Yes. According to the doctor, 
there are no physical abnormalities.

00:18:24.320 --> 00:18:26.580
It seems to be caused by excessive fatigue.

00:18:26.580 --> 00:18:30.210
The ceremony is the day 
after tomorrow, goodness me.

00:18:30.210 --> 00:18:33.040
So the ceremony is more 
important than his condition?!

00:18:33.040 --> 00:18:33.960
You Keika!

00:18:35.030 --> 00:18:37.630
The time to replace him might have come.

00:18:38.130 --> 00:18:41.470
I won't stop you should 
that be the case, Jiun.

00:18:43.600 --> 00:18:48.230
However, be prepared for the
 consequences of your decision.

00:18:48.700 --> 00:18:51.100
<i>Why has even the old lady turned cold?</i>

00:18:53.930 --> 00:18:58.190
<i>I thought you were the most important 
person in this household.</i>

00:18:58.190 --> 00:19:01.990
<i>Now I wonder, what exactly is the Youmeishi?</i>

00:19:03.860 --> 00:19:05.750
A disposable tool?

00:19:05.750 --> 00:19:07.370
That's right.

00:19:07.780 --> 00:19:09.620
That is the fate of the Youmeishi.

00:19:09.620 --> 00:19:11.750
Then why do you want to be the Youmeishi?

00:19:12.180 --> 00:19:13.350
Jimei-niisan.

00:19:18.510 --> 00:19:21.300
As I thought, this isn't just a normal coma.

00:19:21.300 --> 00:19:23.040
He's being possessed by nightmares.

00:19:23.040 --> 00:19:24.080
Nightmares?

00:19:24.080 --> 00:19:28.100
Painful memories can sometimes 
become an immense negative power

00:19:28.640 --> 00:19:32.610
and force the person to relive 
those memories through nightmares.

00:19:33.460 --> 00:19:36.620
And they might never wake up.

00:19:39.110 --> 00:19:41.350
There are so many energy lines.

00:19:41.350 --> 00:19:42.860
And they're all black!

00:19:42.860 --> 00:19:47.240
A normal human would be saved 
just by cutting these lines.

00:19:47.240 --> 00:19:50.000
<i>This is just like that time!</i>

00:19:54.210 --> 00:19:55.340
Wait.

00:19:56.100 --> 00:19:58.730
He is the Youmeishi who carries 
the wishes of many people.

00:19:58.730 --> 00:20:01.720
He has thousands of times as many
 energy lines as a regular person.

00:20:01.720 --> 00:20:03.270
Can you cut them all?

00:20:03.270 --> 00:20:04.680
Then what should I do?

00:20:05.080 --> 00:20:07.180
There is a red mark on his hand.

00:20:09.710 --> 00:20:11.560
It's sealing the path to the underworld.

00:20:12.030 --> 00:20:15.940
If you enter it, you will 
understand his soul's memories.

00:20:16.420 --> 00:20:20.490
The only one who can remove 
the seal is his spirit shadow.

00:20:20.490 --> 00:20:26.440
Only you can travel to the underworld
 and save him from the nightmares.

00:20:26.440 --> 00:20:29.080
You'll have to manage the rest yourself.

00:20:29.770 --> 00:20:32.580
You want to be the Youmeishi, right?
Why are you helping him?

00:20:33.550 --> 00:20:35.460
Don't underestimate me.

00:20:39.490 --> 00:20:42.220
Tanmoku Ki's soul ocean...

00:20:42.870 --> 00:20:46.220
I have to go there again.

00:20:58.670 --> 00:21:02.430
Tanmoku Ki's soul ocean is this stormy?

00:21:06.650 --> 00:21:07.580
Don't look.

00:21:08.090 --> 00:21:09.510
You don't need to see it.

00:21:10.050 --> 00:21:15.250
I'm sorry, Tanmoku Ki. I want 
to know why you're suffering.

00:21:15.250 --> 00:21:16.890
I don't want to lose you.

00:21:17.980 --> 00:21:21.450
That's why I don't care what happens!

00:21:25.650 --> 00:21:30.230
I have to do this to protect you, Tanmoku Ki!

00:21:37.150 --> 00:21:38.370
Master priest.

00:21:39.450 --> 00:21:40.580
<i>Priest?</i>

00:21:43.690 --> 00:21:45.780
<i>That's Tanmoku Ki?</i>

00:21:47.410 --> 00:21:49.530
<i>I've never seen him like this before.</i>

00:21:50.150 --> 00:21:51.310
What's your name?

00:21:52.630 --> 00:21:55.650
